y. He's a sporty type and is captain of the basketball team. Homura may look rough around the edges and act on the aggressive side, but people seem to like him once they get to know him. He's active throughout a lot of the day, staying out late most nights."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c145679"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da7f067cadf10e84d9dd039c7119911980f6b751d79a5853d77d1364e389d589.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75af7d6c492f876f19a355db5921046c49342e0ba75db31113679950170888e3.webp","width":222,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149285","characterName":"謎の青年","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149285"},"originalCharacterName":"謎の青年","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious man who seems to know a lot about Yokai. He drops by from time to time to offer the player advice. His attitude is condescending, and he seems to enjoy watching the new landlord struggle to figure out the Yokai's true identities. For all that, though, he's an invaluable ally in rooting out the monsters hiding among the building's tenants."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149285"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf709637e6b396a511cfa43caa6522dd79eb79741db052d5f81ff40f22c959c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/27190d36c093c1ba5cad3a89fabaad39393642ebdde1359a97c5299df23df1b4.webp","width":233,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149286","characterName":"清水 こだま","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149286"},"originalCharacterName":"清水 こだま","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"824"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"147"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young woman who does her best to avoid or shrug off contact with others. In spite of what her short stature and youthful appearance might suggest, she's a full-fledged responsible adult. When speaking to other \"adults\", she's incredibly cautious and comes across as a little unfriendly."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149286"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b54ef6f7208c91a9ff530bb20640f076ec627f7debcfd9b700f4a7b2f5ba67c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/535dc4d222154a2d81da7e156e5e9e43fffc1ff880fe02d5e2a1a39b11c81e85.webp","width":232,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149287","characterName":"木枯 三郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149287"},"originalCharacterName":"木枯 三郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"901"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A timid young man who spends most of his time indoors, even taking his college classes remotely. He's extremely nervous in social situations; just making eye contact with another person is enough to make him start trembling. Surprisingly, he's actually a member of an extracurricular club. Unsurprisingly, he only participates in the group chat and never goes to meetings in person."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149287"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fb0f9de4ebe8f7d7e80bab4efbfb733cd2db672ca26a2941547fda48b50d36a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b3bd2111e4f9ebc8f911e5cf1fa9de569fc1c8da026e8b9e66b123eae02f0d5.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149288","characterName":"月音 伝八","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149288"},"originalCharacterName":"月音 伝八","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"22"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"410"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An outgoing young journalist who moved to the city for work. This is his first time living on his own, and he's a little naive when it comes to the more practical side of life. Denba can get very passionate when properly motivated, but seldom thinks of the consequences his actions have, both for himself and for others."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149288"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36a49e9ff30e3977552c527b8945e9e644b87bf286862622cb0ee91afc3b00be.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a90a6c488d6cbed797695911d3a6ba3b5d3493736b3e203331a4ac3dcbe5312f.webp","width":241,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151855","characterName":"一目 驚大","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151855"},"originalCharacterName":"一目 驚大","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1208"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the founding members of the Shadow Glove Troupe, a local theater group."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyota has played a wide range of roles in his time, and though his acrobatic skills are top notch, he has yet to find any real fame as an actor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He refers to himself as \"The All-Seeing Eye\" and often gets carried away with over-the-top theatrics. Throughout all of this, however, he still manages to speak in a reasonable, respectful manner."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c151855"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1ef93fb9105f9ce9c271bf367fbd4ef03cbeaa333891b37cfc349010ce59d333.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b507440a499b07c40d8f25223cb0f2056f97acfd7d3ffb5799d58188747324f4.webp","width":234,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151856","characterName":"夜鳥 噤美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151856"},"originalCharacterName":"夜鳥 噤美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"526"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An actress attached to the Shadow Glove Troupe, a local theater group. She works with Kyota Hitome a lot, although he has more experience."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A skilled ventriloquist, she often speaks through the snake puppet that she wears around her neck."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In contrast to Tsugumi's bright personality, \"Nekkun\" is snarky and confrontational, almost as if he's not a part of her at all..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c151856"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d6f048a02589436ba694d81a898e59f76cadad2cbf1a907d9c34fa61bb35f1b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba39c0c3ba2bb5632d1a3a350afa8c6459e09749e611c72d52ead2a7437b46ec.webp","width":238,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151857","characterName":"朽名 巳姫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151857"},"originalCharacterName":"朽名 巳姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"s